    <briefdescription>
<para>Dedicated listener for <ref refid="struct_app_model" kindref="compound">AppModel</ref> config changes (font, cursor, padding). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Separated from <ref refid="classterminal_1_1_display" kindref="compound">Display</ref>&apos;s own <ref refid="classValueTree_1_1Listener" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">ValueTree::Listener</ref> to avoid double-fire: SESSION is grafted under <ref refid="struct_app_model" kindref="compound">AppModel</ref>, so a single Listener on both trees receives terminal PARAM changes twice. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
